From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@local>
Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 00:00:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_eth_soc: adapt 8X DSA PPPQ offload path

Adapt the vendor 8X DSA/PPE/QDMA/PPPQ datapath for the 6.12 driver.
This covers multi-DSA user queue mapping, QDMA queue paging, PPPQ runtime
mode selection, short TCP ACK priority queues, adaptive PPPQ accounting, and
the PPE cache preserved-line lock, while keeping the upstream flowtable ABI.

Signed-off-by: Codex <codex@local>
---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c
